lang: check completion statuses and interaction scopes; prove polarized refinement

P5 distinguishes a witnessed completion, named open obligations, checked finite-domain
refutation and an unsupported procedure. Search exhaustion is not impossibility; unfilled
atoms suspend under negation. Alternating simulation preserves safety of mixed peer sessions.

